       Maven/surefire leftovers.
    10. Schema rule. Never alter CREATE_TABLE; append to the migrations array. Breaking it
        corrupts existing databases.
    11. H2 bump irreversible. After opening with 2.5.252, no return to 2.3.232.
    12. CI blind spot. No MariaDB service container — only h2-compat runs.

    Fixed since the previous pass, and verified in code: the undo-buffer data race (was
